---
import { SITE } from '@/lib/site';
---

<section id="about" class="relative py-24 sm:py-36 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-soft" data-reveal>
      // 05 · THE SCRIPT
    </p>

    <p
      class="mt-6 font-display text-coral text-lg sm:text-xl tracking-tight"
      data-reveal
    >
      Hi, I'm Mayyar Al-Sharqawi.
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-2 font-display leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-balance"
      style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6.5vw, 6rem);"
      data-reveal
    >
      It's not just about the tools.<br />
      It's about the <em class="not-italic text-coral">story</em>.
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
      <div class="space-y-5 text-ink-soft text-base sm:text-lg text-pretty" data-reveal>
        <p>
          A top-ranked design graduate with expertise in social media design,
          filmmaking, and video editing. Over four years across freelance work,
          social media agencies, and NGOs — I excel in visual storytelling that
          connects and captivates.
        </p>
        <p>
          I also run
          <a
            href="#twig-tech"
            data-cursor-link
            class="text-blue underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2 decoration-blue/40 hover:decoration-blue"
          >
            {SITE.twigTech}
          </a>
          — an Arabic tech content brand exploring the intersection of
          technology and creativity. My passion extends to AI-powered
          workflows and 3D visualization, always pushing the boundaries of
          what’s possible.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-5" data-reveal>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-ink/10 bg-paper p-6 sm:p-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-ink-soft">
            Currently
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl leading-tight">
            Head of Media Department at
            <span class="text-coral">High Gate Academy</span>.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
            Building the institution’s visual narrative — film, design and
            social — and supervising a small media team.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-ink/10 bg-cream-2/60 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-ink-soft">
            Studio toolkit
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-ink text-sm">
            <li>· Premiere Pro</li>
            <li>· DaVinci Resolve</li>
            <li>· After Effects</li>
            <li>· Cinema 4D</li>
            <li>· Photoshop · Illustrator</li>
            <li>· Figma</li>
            <li>· Midjourney · SD</li>
            <li>· Runway · Kling</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
